#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:984
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrivning"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:123
msgid "class"
msgstr "class"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:123
msgid ""
"Specifies the window class. The class is used when querying the option "
"database for the window's other options, to determine the default bindtags "
"for the window, and to select the widget's default layout and style. This "
"option is read-only, and may only be specified when the window is created."
msgstr ""
"Anger fönstrets klass. Klassen används när man frågar efter fönstrets andra "
"alternativ i alternativdatabasen, för att bestämma standardbindtaggar för "
"fönstret och för att välja widgetens standardlayout och -stil. Detta "
"alternativ är skrivskyddat och kan endast anges när fönstret skapas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:130
msgid "cursor"
msgstr "markör"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:130
msgid ""
"Specifies the mouse cursor to be used for the widget.  See the *cursor* "
"option type under :ref:`Tk-option-data-types`. If set to the empty string "
"(the default), the cursor is inherited from the parent widget."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:135
msgid "takefocus"
msgstr "takefocus"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:135
msgid ""
"Determines whether the window accepts the focus during keyboard traversal. "
"0, 1 or an empty string is returned. If 0 is returned, it means that the "
"window should be skipped entirely during keyboard traversal. If 1, it means "
"that the window should receive the input focus as long as it is viewable. "
"And an empty string means that the traversal scripts make the decision about "
"whether or not to focus on the window."
msgstr ""
"Avgör om fönstret accepterar fokus under tangentbordstraversering. 0, 1 "
"eller en tom sträng returneras. Om 0 returneras betyder det att fönstret ska "
"hoppas över helt och hållet under tangentbordstraversering. Om 1 returneras "
"betyder det att fönstret ska ta emot inmatningsfokus så länge det är "
"synligt. Och en tom sträng innebär att traverseringsskriptet fattar beslut "
"om huruvida fönstret ska fokuseras eller inte."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:144
msgid "style"
msgstr "style"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:144
msgid "May be used to specify a custom widget style."
msgstr "Kan användas för att ange en anpassad widgetstil."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:149
msgid "Scrollable widget options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:151
msgid ""
"The following options are supported by widgets that are controlled by a "
"scrollbar."
msgstr "Följande alternativ stöds av widgetar som styrs av en rullningslist."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:159
msgid "xscrollcommand"
msgstr "xscrollcommand"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:159
msgid "Used to communicate with horizontal scrollbars."
msgstr "Används för att kommunicera med horisontella scrollbars."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:161
msgid ""
"When the view in the widget's window changes, the widget calls the "
"*xscrollcommand* callback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:164
msgid ""
"Usually this option consists of the method :meth:`Scrollbar.set <tkinter."
"Scrollbar.set>` of some scrollbar. This will cause the scrollbar to be "
"updated whenever the view in the window changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:169
msgid "yscrollcommand"
msgstr "yscrollcommand"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:169
msgid ""
"Used to communicate with vertical scrollbars. For some more information, see "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Används för att kommunicera med vertikala rullningslister. För mer "
"information, se ovan."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:175
msgid "Label options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:177
msgid ""
"The following options are supported by labels, buttons and other button-like "
"widgets."
msgstr ""
"Följande alternativ stöds av etiketter, knappar och andra knappliknande "
"widgetar."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:185 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:553
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:913
msgid "text"
msgstr "text"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:185
msgid "Specifies a text string to be displayed inside the widget."
msgstr "Anger en textsträng som ska visas inuti widgeten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:187 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:357
msgid "textvariable"
msgstr "textvariable"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:187
msgid ""
"Specifies a name whose value will be used in place of the text option "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"Anger ett namn vars värde kommer att användas i stället för "
"textalternativresursen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:190 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:562
msgid "underline"
msgstr "underline"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:190
msgid ""
"If set, specifies the index (0-based) of a character to underline in the "
"text string. The underline character is used for mnemonic activation."
msgstr ""
"Om inställd, anger indexet (0-baserat) för ett tecken som ska understrykas i "
"textsträngen. Det understrukna tecknet används för mnemonisk aktivering."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:194 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:555
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:915 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:947
msgid "image"
msgstr "image"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:194
msgid ""
"Specifies an image to display. This is a list of 1 or more elements. The "
"first element is the default image name. The rest of the list if a sequence "
"of statespec/value pairs as defined by :meth:`Style.map`, specifying "
"different images to use when the widget is in a particular state or a "
"combination of states. All images in the list should have the same size."
msgstr ""
"Specificerar en bild som ska visas. Detta är en lista med 1 eller flera "
"element. Det första elementet är standardbildnamnet. Resten av listan är en "
"sekvens av statespec/värdepar enligt definitionen i :meth:`Style.map`, som "
"anger olika bilder som ska användas när widgeten befinner sig i ett visst "
"tillstånd eller en kombination av tillstånd. Alla bilder i listan bör ha "
"samma storlek."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:202 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:558
msgid "compound"
msgstr "förening"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:202
msgid ""
"Specifies how to display the image relative to the text, in the case both "
"text and images options are present. Valid values are:"
msgstr ""
"Anger hur bilden ska visas i förhållande till texten, om både text- och "
"bildalternativet finns med. Giltiga värden är:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:206
msgid "text: display text only"
msgstr "text: endast visa text"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:207
msgid "image: display image only"
msgstr "image: endast visa bild"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:208
msgid ""
"top, bottom, left, right: display image above, below, left of, or right of "
"the text, respectively."
msgstr ""
"top, bottom, left, right: visa bilden ovanför, under, till vänster om eller "
"till höger om texten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:210
msgid "none: the default. display the image if present, otherwise the text."
msgstr "none: standard. visar bilden om den finns, annars texten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:213 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:365
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:522
msgid "width"
msgstr "width"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:213
msgid ""
"If greater than zero, specifies how much space, in character widths, to "
"allocate for the text label, if less than zero, specifies a minimum width. "
"If zero or unspecified, the natural width of the text label is used."
msgstr ""
"Om större än noll, anger hur mycket utrymme, i teckenbredd, som ska "
"tilldelas för textetiketten, om mindre än noll, anger en minsta bredd. Om "
"noll eller ospecificerat används den naturliga bredden på textetiketten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:221
msgid "Compatibility options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:228 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:350
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:538
msgid "state"
msgstr "state"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:228
msgid ""
"May be set to \"normal\" or \"disabled\" to control the \"disabled\" state "
"bit. This is a write-only option: setting it changes the widget state, but "
"the :meth:`Widget.state` method does not affect this option."
msgstr ""
"Kan sättas till \"normal\" eller \"disabled\" för att styra \"disabled\"-"
"tillståndsbiten. Det här är ett skrivskyddat alternativ: om du ställer in "
"det ändras widgetens tillstånd, men metoden :meth:`Widget.state` påverkar "
"inte det här alternativet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:235
msgid "Widget states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:237
msgid "The widget state is a bitmap of independent state flags."
msgstr "Widgetens tillstånd är en bitmapp med oberoende tillståndsflaggor."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:242
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Flagga"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:244
msgid "active"
msgstr "active"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:244
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor is over the widget and pressing a mouse button will cause "
"some action to occur"
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren är över widgeten och om du trycker på en musknapp kommer någon "
"åtgärd att utföras"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:247
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "disabled"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:247
msgid "Widget is disabled under program control"
msgstr "Widget är inaktiverad under programkontroll"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:249
msgid "focus"
msgstr "focus"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:249
msgid "Widget has keyboard focus"
msgstr "Widget har fokus på tangentbordet"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:251
msgid "pressed"
msgstr "pressed"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:251
msgid "Widget is being pressed"
msgstr "Widget trycks in"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:253
msgid "selected"
msgstr "selected"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:253
msgid ""
"\"On\", \"true\", or \"current\" for things like Checkbuttons and "
"radiobuttons"
msgstr ""
"\"On\", \"true\" eller \"current\" för t.ex. checkbuttons och radiobuttons"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:256 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:943
msgid "background"
msgstr "background"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:256
msgid ""
"Windows and Mac have a notion of an \"active\" or foreground window. The "
"*background* state is set for widgets in a background window, and cleared "
"for those in the foreground window"
msgstr ""
"Windows och Mac har en uppfattning om ett \"aktivt\" eller förgrundsfönster. "
"Tillståndet *bakgrund* sätts för widgetar i ett bakgrundsfönster och rensas "
"för dem i förgrundsfönstret"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:261
msgid "readonly"
msgstr "skrivskyddad"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:261
msgid "Widget should not allow user modification"
msgstr "Widget ska inte tillåta användarändring"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:263
msgid "alternate"
msgstr "alternate"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:263
msgid "A widget-specific alternate display format"
msgstr "Ett widgetspecifikt alternativt visningsformat"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:265
msgid "invalid"
msgstr "invalid"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:265
msgid "The widget's value is invalid"
msgstr "Widgetens värde är ogiltigt"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:268
msgid ""
"A state specification is a sequence of state names, optionally prefixed with "
"an exclamation point indicating that the bit is off."
msgstr ""
"En tillståndsspecifikation är en sekvens av tillståndsnamn, eventuellt "
"föregångna av ett utropstecken som anger att biten är av."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:273
msgid "ttk.Widget"
msgstr "ttk.Widget"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:275
msgid ""
"Besides the methods described below, the :class:`ttk.Widget <Widget>` "
"supports the methods :meth:`tkinter.Widget.cget <tkinter.Misc.cget>` and :"
"meth:`tkinter.Widget.configure <tkinter.Misc.configure>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:283
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the element at position *x* *y*, or the empty string if "
"the point does not lie within any element."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar namnet på elementet vid position *x* *y*, eller den tomma "
"strängen om punkten inte ligger inom något element."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:286
msgid "*x* and *y* are pixel coordinates relative to the widget."
msgstr "*x* och *y* är pixelkoordinater i förhållande till widgeten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:291
msgid ""
"Test the widget's state. If a callback is not specified, returns ``True`` if "
"the widget state matches *statespec* and ``False`` otherwise. If callback is "
"specified then it is called with args if widget state matches *statespec*."
msgstr ""
"Testar widgetens tillstånd. Om inget callback anges returneras ``True`` om "
"widgetens tillstånd matchar *statespec* och ``False`` annars. Om callback "
"anges anropas den med args om widgetens tillstånd matchar *statespec*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:299
msgid ""
"Modify or inquire widget state. If *statespec* is specified, sets the widget "
"state according to it and return a new *statespec* indicating which flags "
"were changed. If *statespec* is not specified, returns the currently enabled "
"state flags."
msgstr ""
"Modifiera eller fråga om widgetens tillstånd. Om *statespec* anges, ändras "
"widgetens tillstånd enligt specifikationen och en ny *statespec* returneras "
"som anger vilka flaggor som ändrats. Om *statespec* inte specificeras "
"returneras de för närvarande aktiverade tillståndsflaggorna."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:304
msgid "Not to be confused with :meth:`Wm.state <tkinter.Wm.state>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:306
msgid "*statespec* will usually be a list or a tuple."
msgstr "*statespec* är vanligtvis en lista eller en tupel."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:310
msgid "Combobox"
msgstr "Combobox"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:312
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Combobox <Combobox>` widget combines a text field with a pop-"
"down list of values. This widget is a subclass of :class:`Entry`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:316
msgid ""
"Besides the methods inherited from :class:`Widget`: :meth:`~tkinter.Misc."
"cget`, :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.configure`, :meth:`~Widget.identify`, :meth:"
"`~Widget.instate` and :meth:`~Widget.state`, and the following inherited "
"from :class:`Entry`: :meth:`~Entry.bbox`, :meth:`~tkinter.Entry.delete`, :"
"meth:`~tkinter.Entry.icursor`, :meth:`~tkinter.Entry.index`, :meth:`~tkinter."
"Entry.insert`, :meth:`selection* <tkinter.Entry.selection_adjust>`, :meth:"
"`xview* <tkinter.XView.xview>`, it has some other methods, described at :"
"class:`ttk.Combobox <Combobox>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:328 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:421
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:503 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:701
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:773 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:843
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Alternativ"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:330 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:423
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:505 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:703
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:845
msgid "This widget accepts the following specific options:"
msgstr "Denna widget accepterar följande specifika alternativ:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:337
msgid "exportselection"
msgstr "exportselection"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:337
msgid ""
"Boolean value. If set, the widget selection is linked to the X selection "
"(which can be returned by invoking Misc.selection_get, for example)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:341
msgid "justify"
msgstr "justify"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:341
msgid ""
"Specifies how the text is aligned within the widget. One of \"left\", "
"\"center\", or \"right\"."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur texten ska riktas in i widgeten. Ett av alternativen \"left\", "
"\"center\" eller \"right\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:344 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:512
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:860
msgid "height"
msgstr "height"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:344
msgid "Specifies the height of the pop-down listbox, in rows."
msgstr "Anger höjden på popup-listboxen, i rader."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:346
msgid "postcommand"
msgstr "postcommand"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:346
msgid ""
"A script (possibly registered with Misc.register) that is called immediately "
"before displaying the values. It may specify which values to display."
msgstr ""
"Ett skript (eventuellt registrerat med Misc.register) som anropas omedelbart "
"innan värdena visas. Det kan ange vilka värden som ska visas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:350
msgid ""
"One of \"normal\", \"readonly\", or \"disabled\". In the \"readonly\" state, "
"the value may not be edited directly, and the user can only select one of "
"the values from the dropdown list. In the \"normal\" state, the text field "
"is directly editable. In the \"disabled\" state, no interaction is possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:357
msgid ""
"Specifies a name whose value is linked to the widget value. Whenever the "
"value associated with that name changes, the widget value is updated, and "
"vice versa. See :class:`tkinter.StringVar`."
msgstr ""
"Anger ett namn vars värde är kopplat till widgetens värde. När värdet som "
"associeras med namnet ändras, uppdateras widgetens värde och vice versa. Se :"
"klass:`tkinter.StringVar`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:362 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:442
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:917
msgid "values"
msgstr "värden"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:362
msgid "Specifies the list of values to display in the drop-down listbox."
msgstr "Anger listan med värden som ska visas i listrutan."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:365
msgid ""
"Specifies an integer value indicating the desired width of the entry window, "
"in average-size characters of the widget's font."
msgstr ""
"Anger ett heltal som anger den önskade bredden på inmatningsfönstret, i "
"tecken av genomsnittlig storlek i widgetens typsnitt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:372
msgid ""
"Tk 9.1 added the *locale* option, which selects the locale used to determine "
"word and character boundaries within the text (``\"C\"`` by default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:377 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:467
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:584 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:977
msgid "Virtual events"
msgstr "Virtuella händelser"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:379
msgid ""
"The combobox widgets generates a **<<ComboboxSelected>>** virtual event when "
"the user selects an element from the list of values."
msgstr ""
"Combobox-widgetarna genererar en **&lt;<ComboboxSelected>&gt;** virtuell "
"händelse när användaren väljer ett element från listan med värden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:384
msgid "ttk.Combobox"
msgstr "ttk.Combobox"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:390
msgid ""
"If *newindex* is specified, sets the combobox value to the element position "
"*newindex*. Otherwise, returns the index of the current value or -1 if the "
"current value is not in the values list."
msgstr ""
"Om *newindex* anges sätts combobox-värdet till elementpositionen *newindex*. "
"I annat fall returneras indexet för det aktuella värdet eller -1 om det "
"aktuella värdet inte finns i värdelistan."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:397
msgid "Returns the current value of the combobox."
msgstr "Returnerar det aktuella värdet för kombinationsrutan."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:402
msgid "Sets the value of the combobox to *value*."
msgstr "Ställer in värdet på kombinationsrutan till *värde*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:406
msgid "Spinbox"
msgstr "Spinbox"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:408
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Spinbox <Spinbox>` widget is a :class:`ttk.Entry <Entry>` "
"enhanced with increment and decrement arrows. It can be used for numbers or "
"lists of string values. This widget is a subclass of :class:`Entry`. Besides "
"the methods inherited from :class:`Widget`: :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.cget`, :"
"meth:`~tkinter.Misc.configure`, :meth:`~Widget.identify`, :meth:`~Widget."
"instate` and :meth:`~Widget.state`, and the following inherited from :class:"
"`Entry`: :meth:`~Entry.bbox`, :meth:`~tkinter.Entry.delete`, :meth:`~tkinter."
"Entry.icursor`, :meth:`~tkinter.Entry.index`, :meth:`~tkinter.Entry."
"insert`, :meth:`xview* <tkinter.XView.xview>`, it has some other methods, "
"described at :class:`ttk.Spinbox <Spinbox>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:430
msgid "from"
msgstr "from"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:430
msgid ""
"Float value.  If set, this is the minimum value to which the decrement "
"button will decrement.  Must be spelled as ``from_`` when used as an "
"argument, since ``from`` is a Python keyword."
msgstr ""
"Flytande värde.  Om värdet är inställt är detta det lägsta värde som "
"decrement-knappen kommer att decremera till.  Måste stavas som ``from_`` när "
"det används som argument, eftersom ``from`` är ett Python-nyckelord."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:435
msgid "to"
msgstr "till"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:435
msgid ""
"Float value.  If set, this is the maximum value to which the increment "
"button will increment."
msgstr ""
"Flytande värde.  Om det är inställt är detta det maximala värde som "
"inkrementeringsknappen kommer att inkrementera till."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:438
msgid "increment"
msgstr "increment"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:438
msgid ""
"Float value.  Specifies the amount which the increment/decrement buttons "
"change the value. Defaults to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Flytande värde.  Anger det belopp som knapparna för ökning/minskning ändrar "
"värdet med. Standardvärdet är 1,0."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:442
msgid ""
"Sequence of string or float values.  If specified, the increment/decrement "
"buttons will cycle through the items in this sequence rather than "
"incrementing or decrementing numbers."
msgstr ""
"Sekvens av sträng- eller floatvärden.  Om detta anges kommer knapparna för "
"inkrementering/dekrementering att bläddra igenom objekten i sekvensen i "
"stället för att inkrementera eller dekrementera siffror."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:448
msgid "wrap"
msgstr "wrap"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:448
msgid ""
"Boolean value.  If ``True``, increment and decrement buttons will cycle from "
"the ``to`` value to the ``from`` value or the ``from`` value to the ``to`` "
"value, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Booleanskt värde.  Om ``True``, kommer knapparna för ökning och minskning "
"att cykla från ``to``-värdet till ``from``-värdet respektive ``from``-värdet "
"till ``to``-värdet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:453
msgid "format"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:453
msgid ""
"String value.  This specifies the format of numbers set by the increment/"
"decrement buttons.  It must be in the form \"%W.Pf\", where W is the padded "
"width of the value, P is the precision, and '%' and 'f' are literal."
msgstr ""
"Strängvärde.  Detta anger formatet för de tal som anges med knapparna för "
"ökning/minskning.  Det måste vara i formen \"%W.Pf\", där W är den utfyllda "
"bredden på värdet, P är precisionen och \"%\" och \"f\" är bokstavliga."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:459
msgid "command"
msgstr "command"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:459
msgid ""
"Python callable.  Will be called with no arguments whenever either of the "
"increment or decrement buttons are pressed."
msgstr ""
"Python-kallbar.  Anropas utan argument när någon av knapparna för ökning "
"eller minskning trycks in."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:469
msgid ""
"The spinbox widget generates an **<<Increment>>** virtual event when the "
"user presses <Up>, and a **<<Decrement>>** virtual event when the user "
"presses <Down>."
msgstr ""
"Spinbox-widgeten genererar en **&lt;<Increment>&gt;** virtuell händelse när "
"användaren trycker på <Up>, och en **&lt;<Decrement>&gt;** virtuell händelse "
"när användaren trycker på <Down>."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:474
msgid "ttk.Spinbox"
msgstr "ttk.Spinbox"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:478
msgid ""
"With a non-integer increment, see :ref:`numeric values and the locale "
"<tkinter-numeric-locale>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:485
msgid "Returns the current value of the spinbox."
msgstr "Returnerar det aktuella värdet för spinboxen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:490
msgid "Sets the value of the spinbox to *value*."
msgstr "Ställer in värdet på spinboxen till *värde*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:495
msgid "Notebook"
msgstr "Laptop"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:497
msgid ""
"Ttk Notebook widget manages a collection of windows and displays a single "
"one at a time. Each child window is associated with a tab, which the user "
"may select to change the currently displayed window."
msgstr ""
"Ttk Notebook widget hanterar en samling fönster och visar ett enda åt "
"gången. Varje underordnat fönster är associerat med en flik som användaren "
"kan välja för att ändra det fönster som visas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:512
msgid ""
"If present and greater than zero, specifies the desired height of the pane "
"area (not including internal padding or tabs). Otherwise, the maximum height "
"of all panes is used."
msgstr ""
"Om den finns och är större än noll, anger den önskade höjden på rutområdet "
"(exklusive intern utfyllnad eller flikar). I annat fall används den maximala "
"höjden för alla rutor."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:516 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:549
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:864
msgid "padding"
msgstr "padding"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:516
msgid ""
"Specifies the amount of extra space to add around the outside of the "
"notebook. The padding is a list up to four length specifications left top "
"right bottom. If fewer than four elements are specified, bottom defaults to "
"top, right defaults to left, and top defaults to left."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur mycket extra utrymme som ska läggas till runt utsidan av den "
"bärbara datorn. Utfyllnaden är en lista med upp till fyra längdangivelser "
"left top right bottom. Om färre än fyra element anges är bottom "
"standardvärde för top, right standardvärde för left och top standardvärde "
"för left."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:522
msgid ""
"If present and greater than zero, specified the desired width of the pane "
"area (not including internal padding). Otherwise, the maximum width of all "
"panes is used."
msgstr ""
"Om den finns och är större än noll, anges den önskade bredden på rutans "
"område (exklusive intern utfyllnad). I annat fall används den maximala "
"bredden för alla rutor."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:529
msgid "Tab options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:531
msgid "There are also specific options for tabs:"
msgstr "Det finns också specifika alternativ för flikar:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:538
msgid ""
"Either \"normal\", \"disabled\" or \"hidden\". If \"disabled\", then the tab "
"is not selectable. If \"hidden\", then the tab is not shown."
msgstr ""
"Antingen \"normal\", \"disabled\" eller \"hidden\". Om \"disabled\", är "
"fliken inte valbar. Om den är \"hidden\" visas inte fliken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:542
msgid "sticky"
msgstr "sticky"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:542
msgid ""
"Specifies how the child window is positioned within the pane area. Value is "
"a string containing zero or more of the characters \"n\", \"s\", \"e\" or "
"\"w\". Each letter refers to a side (north, south, east or west) that the "
"child window will stick to, as per the :meth:`grid <tkinter.Grid.grid>` "
"geometry manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:549
msgid ""
"Specifies the amount of extra space to add between the notebook and this "
"pane. Syntax is the same as for the option padding used by this widget."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur mycket extra utrymme som ska läggas till mellan anteckningsboken "
"och den här rutan. Syntaxen är densamma som för alternativet padding som "
"används av denna widget."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:553
msgid "Specifies a text to be displayed in the tab."
msgstr "Anger en text som ska visas i fliken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:555
msgid ""
"Specifies an image to display in the tab. See the option image described in :"
"class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Anger en bild som ska visas i fliken. Se alternativet bild som beskrivs i :"
"class:`Widget`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:558
msgid ""
"Specifies how to display the image relative to the text, in the case both "
"options text and image are present. See `Label Options`_ for legal values."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur bilden ska visas i förhållande till texten, om både alternativen "
"text och bild finns med. Se `Label Options`_ för lagliga värden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:562
msgid ""
"Specifies the index (0-based) of a character to underline in the text "
"string. The underlined character is used for mnemonic activation if :meth:"
"`Notebook.enable_traversal` is called."
msgstr ""
"Anger index (0-baserat) för ett tecken som ska understrykas i textsträngen. "
"Det understrukna tecknet används för mnemonisk aktivering om :meth:`Notebook."
"enable_traversal` anropas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:570
msgid "Tab identifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:572
msgid ""
"The tab_id present in several methods of :class:`ttk.Notebook <Notebook>` "
"may take any of the following forms:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:575
msgid "An integer between zero and the number of tabs"
msgstr "Ett heltal mellan noll och antalet flikar"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:576
msgid "The name of a child window"
msgstr "Namnet på ett underordnat fönster"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:577
msgid ""
"A positional specification of the form \"@x,y\", which identifies the tab"
msgstr "En positionsangivelse av formen \"@x,y\", som identifierar fliken"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:578
msgid ""
"The literal string \"current\", which identifies the currently selected tab"
msgstr ""
"Den bokstavliga strängen \"current\", som identifierar den flik som är "
"markerad för tillfället"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:579
msgid ""
"The literal string \"end\", which returns the number of tabs (only valid "
"for :meth:`Notebook.index`)"
msgstr ""
"Den bokstavliga strängen \"end\", som returnerar antalet flikar (endast "
"giltig för :meth:`Notebook.index`)"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:586
msgid ""
"This widget generates a **<<NotebookTabChanged>>** virtual event after a new "
"tab is selected."
msgstr ""
"Denna widget genererar en **&lt;<NotebookTabChanged>&gt;** virtuell händelse "
"efter att en ny flik har valts."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:591
msgid "ttk.Notebook"
msgstr "ttk.Notebook"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:597
msgid "Adds a new tab to the notebook."
msgstr "Lägger till en ny flik i anteckningsboken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:599
msgid ""
"If window is currently managed by the notebook but hidden, it is restored to "
"its previous position."
msgstr ""
"Om fönstret för närvarande hanteras av den bärbara datorn men är dolt, "
"återställs det till sin tidigare position."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:602 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:645
msgid "See `Tab Options`_ for the list of available options."
msgstr "Se `Tab Options`_ för en lista över tillgängliga alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:607
msgid ""
"Removes the tab specified by *tab_id*, unmaps and unmanages the associated "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort den flik som anges av *tab_id*, avmapsar och avhanterar det "
"associerade fönstret."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:610 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1815
msgid ""
"This shadows the inherited geometry-manager :meth:`!forget`; use :meth:"
"`~tkinter.Pack.pack_forget`, :meth:`~tkinter.Grid.grid_forget` or :meth:"
"`~tkinter.Place.place_forget` to remove the widget itself from its manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:618
msgid "Hides the tab specified by *tab_id*."
msgstr "Döljer den flik som anges av *tab_id*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:620
msgid ""
"The tab will not be displayed, but the associated window remains managed by "
"the notebook and its configuration remembered. Hidden tabs may be restored "
"with the :meth:`add` command."
msgstr ""
"Fliken kommer inte att visas, men det associerade fönstret kommer att "
"hanteras av notebook och dess konfiguration kommer att sparas. Dolda flikar "
"kan återställas med kommandot :meth:`add`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:627
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the tab element at position *x*, *y*, or the empty "
"string if none."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar namnet på tabb-elementet på position *x*, *y*, eller den tomma "
"strängen om det inte finns något."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:633
msgid ""
"Returns the numeric index of the tab specified by *tab_id*, or the total "
"number of tabs if *tab_id* is the string \"end\"."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar det numeriska indexet för den flik som anges av *tab_id*, eller "
"det totala antalet flikar om *tab_id* är strängen \"end\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:639
msgid "Inserts a pane at the specified position."
msgstr "Infogar en ruta på den angivna positionen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:641
msgid ""
"*pos* is either the string \"end\", an integer index, or the name of a "
"managed child. If *child* is already managed by the notebook, moves it to "
"the specified position."
msgstr ""
"*pos* är antingen strängen \"end\", ett heltalsindex eller namnet på ett "
"hanterat barn. Om *child* redan hanteras av notebook flyttas det till den "
"angivna positionen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:650
msgid "Selects the specified *tab_id*."
msgstr "Väljer den angivna *tab_id*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:652
msgid ""
"The associated child window will be displayed, and the previously selected "
"window (if different) is unmapped. If *tab_id* is omitted, returns the "
"widget name of the currently selected pane."
msgstr ""
"Det associerade underordnade fönstret visas och det tidigare valda fönstret "
"(om det är ett annat) avmappas. Om *tab_id* inte anges returneras "
"widgetnamnet för den aktuella valda rutan."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:659
msgid "Query or modify the options of the specific *tab_id*."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra alternativen för den specifika *tab_id*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:661
msgid ""
"If *kw* is not given, returns a dictionary of the tab option values. If "
"*option* is specified, returns the value of that *option*. Otherwise, sets "
"the options to the corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"Om *kw* inte anges, returneras en ordbok med värden för flikalternativ. Om "
"*option* anges, returneras värdet för det *option*. I annat fall sätts "
"alternativen till motsvarande värden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:668
msgid "Returns a tuple of windows managed by the notebook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:673
msgid ""
"Enable keyboard traversal for a toplevel window containing this notebook."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera tangentbordstraversering för ett toplevel-fönster som innehåller "
"denna anteckningsbok."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:675
msgid ""
"This will extend the bindings for the toplevel window containing the "
"notebook as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Detta kommer att utöka bindningarna för fönstret på översta nivån som "
"innehåller anteckningsboken enligt följande:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:678
msgid ""
":kbd:`Control-Tab`: selects the tab following the currently selected one."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Control-Tab`: väljer fliken efter den flik som för närvarande är vald."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:679
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift-Control-Tab`: selects the tab preceding the currently selected "
"one."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Shift-Control-Tab`: väljer den flik som föregår den flik som för "
"närvarande är vald."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:680
msgid ""
":kbd:`Alt-K`: where *K* is the mnemonic (underlined) character of any tab, "
"will select that tab."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Alt-K`: där *K* är det mnemoniska (understrukna) tecknet för en flik, "
"kommer att välja den fliken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:683
msgid ""
"Multiple notebooks in a single toplevel may be enabled for traversal, "
"including nested notebooks. However, notebook traversal only works properly "
"if all panes are direct children of the notebook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:690
msgid "Progressbar"
msgstr "Progressbar"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:692
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Progressbar <Progressbar>` widget shows the status of a long-"
"running operation. It can operate in two modes: 1) the determinate mode "
"which shows the amount completed relative to the total amount of work to be "
"done and 2) the indeterminate mode which provides an animated display to let "
"the user know that work is progressing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:710 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:782
msgid "orient"
msgstr "orient"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:710
msgid ""
"One of \"horizontal\" or \"vertical\". Specifies the orientation of the "
"progress bar."
msgstr ""
"Ett av alternativen \"horisontell\" eller \"vertikal\". Anger "
"förloppsindikatorns orientering."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:713
msgid "length"
msgstr "length"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:713
msgid ""
"Specifies the length of the long axis of the progress bar (width if "
"horizontal, height if vertical)."
msgstr ""
"Anger längden på förloppsindikatorns långa axel (bredd om den är "
"horisontell, höjd om den är vertikal)."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:716
msgid "mode"
msgstr "läge"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:716
msgid "One of \"determinate\" or \"indeterminate\"."
msgstr "En av \"determinate\" eller \"indeterminate\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:718
msgid "maximum"
msgstr "maximum"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:718
msgid "A number specifying the maximum value. Defaults to 100."
msgstr "Ett tal som anger det maximala värdet. Standardvärdet är 100."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:720
msgid "value"
msgstr "värde"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:720
msgid ""
"The current value of the progress bar. In \"determinate\" mode, this "
"represents the amount of work completed. In \"indeterminate\" mode, it is "
"interpreted as modulo *maximum*; that is, the progress bar completes one "
"\"cycle\" when its value increases by *maximum*."
msgstr ""
"Det aktuella värdet på förloppsindikatorn. I \"determinate\"-läget "
"representerar detta hur mycket arbete som har slutförts. I läget "
"\"Indeterminate\" tolkas det som modulo *maximum*, dvs. förloppsindikatorn "
"fullbordar en \"cykel\" när dess värde ökar med *maximum*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:726
msgid "variable"
msgstr "variable"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:726
msgid ""
"A name which is linked to the option value. If specified, the value of the "
"progress bar is automatically set to the value of this name whenever the "
"latter is modified."
msgstr ""
"Ett namn som är kopplat till optionens värde. Om det anges kommer värdet på "
"förloppsindikatorn automatiskt att ställas in på värdet för detta namn när "
"det senare ändras."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:730
msgid "phase"
msgstr "phase"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:730
msgid ""
"Read-only option. The widget periodically increments the value of this "
"option whenever its value is greater than 0 and, in determinate mode, less "
"than maximum. This option may be used by the current theme to provide "
"additional animation effects."
msgstr ""
"Skrivskyddat alternativ. Widgeten ökar periodiskt värdet på detta alternativ "
"när dess värde är större än 0 och, i determinate-läge, mindre än maximum. "
"Detta alternativ kan användas av det aktuella temat för att ge ytterligare "
"animationseffekter."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:738
msgid "ttk.Progressbar"
msgstr "ttk.Progressbar"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:744
msgid ""
"Begin autoincrement mode: schedules a recurring timer event that calls :meth:"
"`Progressbar.step` every *interval* milliseconds. If omitted, *interval* "
"defaults to 50 milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Starta autoincrement-läge: schemalägger en återkommande timerhändelse som "
"anropar :meth:`Progressbar.step` varje *intervall* millisekunder. Om "
"*interval* utelämnas är standardvärdet 50 millisekunder."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:751
msgid "Increments the progress bar's value by *amount*."
msgstr "Ökar förloppsindikatorns värde med *belopp*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:753
msgid "*amount* defaults to 1.0 if omitted."
msgstr "*amount* är standardvärdet 1.0 om det utelämnas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:758
msgid ""
"Stop autoincrement mode: cancels any recurring timer event initiated by :"
"meth:`Progressbar.start` for this progress bar."
msgstr ""
"Stop autoincrement mode: avbryter alla återkommande timerhändelser som "
"initierats av :meth:`Progressbar.start` för denna progressbar."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:763
msgid "Separator"
msgstr "Separator"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:765
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Separator <Separator>` widget displays a horizontal or "
"vertical separator bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:768
msgid ""
"It has no other methods besides the ones inherited from :class:`ttk.Widget "
"<Widget>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:775
msgid "This widget accepts the following specific option:"
msgstr "Denna widget accepterar följande specifika alternativ:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:782
msgid ""
"One of \"horizontal\" or \"vertical\". Specifies the orientation of the "
"separator."
msgstr ""
"Ett av alternativen \"horisontell\" eller \"vertikal\". Anger separatorns "
"orientering."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:788
msgid "Sizegrip"
msgstr "Sizegrip"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:790
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Sizegrip <Sizegrip>` widget (also known as a grow box) "
"allows the user to resize the containing toplevel window by pressing and "
"dragging the grip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:794
msgid ""
"This widget has neither specific options nor specific methods, besides the "
"ones inherited from :class:`ttk.Widget <Widget>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:799
msgid "Platform-specific notes"
msgstr "Plattformsspecifika anmärkningar"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:801
msgid ""
"On macOS, toplevel windows automatically include a built-in size grip by "
"default. Adding a :class:`Sizegrip` is harmless, since the built-in grip "
"will just mask the widget."
msgstr ""
"På macOS inkluderar toplevel-fönster automatiskt ett inbyggt storleksgrepp "
"som standard. Att lägga till en :class:`Sizegrip` är ofarligt, eftersom det "
"inbyggda greppet bara kommer att maskera widgeten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:807
msgid "Bugs"
msgstr ""
"Vi checkar av WordPress.org forumet under hela veckan, och tittar efter "
"buggar. Om du rapporterar en legitim bugg som vi kan reproducera, kommer vi "
"loggar det och patcha för en kommande uppdatering. Men vi kan tyvärr inte ge "
"anpassningstips eller hjälpa till att integrera med 3: e parts plugins eller "
"teman"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:809
msgid ""
"If the containing toplevel's position was specified relative to the right or "
"bottom of the screen (for example, ....), the :class:`Sizegrip` widget will "
"not resize the window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:812
msgid "This widget supports only \"southeast\" resizing."
msgstr "Denna widget stöder endast \"southeast\"-storleksändring."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:816
msgid "Treeview"
msgstr "Treeview"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:818
msgid ""
"The :class:`ttk.Treeview <Treeview>` widget displays a hierarchical "
"collection of items. Each item has a textual label, an optional image, and "
"an optional list of data values. The data values are displayed in successive "
"columns after the tree label."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:824
msgid ""
"The order in which data values are displayed may be controlled by setting "
"the widget option ``displaycolumns``. The tree widget can also display "
"column headings. Columns may be accessed by number or symbolic names listed "
"in the widget option columns. See `Column Identifiers`_."
msgstr ""
"Den ordning i vilken datavärdena visas kan styras genom att ställa in "
"widgetalternativet ``displaycolumns``. Trädwidgeten kan också visa "
"kolumnrubriker. Kolumnerna kan nås med nummer eller symboliska namn som "
"anges i widgetalternativet columns. Se `Kolumnidentifierare`_."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:829
msgid ""
"Each item is identified by a unique name. The widget will generate item IDs "
"if they are not supplied by the caller. There is a distinguished root item, "
"named ``{}``. The root item itself is not displayed; its children appear at "
"the top level of the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Varje objekt identifieras med ett unikt namn. Widgeten genererar objekt-ID:n "
"om de inte tillhandahålls av den som anropar. Det finns ett unikt rotobjekt "
"som heter ``{}``. Själva rotobjektet visas inte, utan dess barn visas högst "
"upp i hierarkin."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:834
msgid ""
"Each item also has a list of tags, which can be used to associate event "
"bindings with individual items and control the appearance of the item."
msgstr ""
"Varje objekt har också en lista med taggar, som kan användas för att "
"associera händelsebindningar med enskilda objekt och styra utseendet på "
"objektet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:837
msgid ""
"The Treeview widget supports horizontal and vertical scrolling, according to "
"the options described in `Scrollable Widget Options`_ and the methods :meth:"
"`Treeview.xview` and :meth:`Treeview.yview`."
msgstr ""
"Treeview-widgeten stöder horisontell och vertikal rullning, enligt de "
"alternativ som beskrivs i `Scrollable Widget Options`_ och metoderna :meth:"
"`Treeview.xview` och :meth:`Treeview.yview`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:852
msgid "columns"
msgstr "columns"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:852
msgid ""
"A list of column identifiers, specifying the number of columns and their "
"names."
msgstr ""
"En lista med kolumnidentifierare som anger antalet kolumner och deras namn."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:855
msgid "displaycolumns"
msgstr "displaykolumner"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:855
msgid ""
"A list of column identifiers (either symbolic or integer indices) specifying "
"which data columns are displayed and the order in which they appear, or the "
"string \"#all\"."
msgstr ""
"En lista med kolumnidentifierare (antingen symboliska index eller "
"heltalsindex) som anger vilka datakolumner som ska visas och i vilken "
"ordning de ska visas, eller strängen \"#all\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:860
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of rows which should be visible. Note: the requested "
"width is determined from the sum of the column widths."
msgstr ""
"Anger antalet rader som ska vara synliga. Observera: den begärda bredden "
"bestäms av summan av kolumnbredderna."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:864
msgid ""
"Specifies the internal padding for the widget. The padding is a list of up "
"to four length specifications."
msgstr ""
"Anger den interna utfyllnaden för widgeten. Utfyllnaden är en lista med upp "
"till fyra längdspecifikationer."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:867
msgid "selectmode"
msgstr "välj läge"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:867
msgid ""
"Controls how the built-in class bindings manage the selection. One of "
"\"extended\", \"browse\" or \"none\". If set to \"extended\" (the default), "
"multiple items may be selected. If \"browse\", only a single item will be "
"selected at a time. If \"none\", the selection will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Styr hur de inbyggda klassbindningarna hanterar urvalet. Ett av alternativen "
"\"extended\", \"browse\" eller \"none\". Om inställningen är "
"\"extended\" (standard) kan flera objekt väljas. Om \"browse\" används "
"kommer endast ett objekt att väljas åt gången. Om \"none\" används kommer "
"valet inte att ändras."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:874
msgid ""
"Note that the application code and tag bindings can set the selection "
"however they wish, regardless of the value  of this option."
msgstr ""
"Observera att programkoden och taggbindningarna kan ställa in urvalet hur de "
"vill, oavsett värdet på detta alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:878
msgid "show"
msgstr "visa"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:878
msgid ""
"A list containing zero or more of the following values, specifying which "
"elements of the tree to display."
msgstr ""
"En lista som innehåller noll eller flera av följande värden och som anger "
"vilka element i trädet som ska visas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:881
msgid "tree: display tree labels in column #0."
msgstr "tree: visa trädetiketter i kolumn #0."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:882
msgid "headings: display the heading row."
msgstr "headings: visa rubrikraden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:884
msgid "The default is \"tree headings\", that is, show all elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:887
msgid ""
"**Note**: Column #0 always refers to the tree column, even if show=\"tree\" "
"is not specified."
msgstr ""
"**Notera**: Kolumn #0 hänvisar alltid till trädkolumnen, även om "
"show=\"tree\" inte har angetts."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:893
msgid ""
"Tk 9.0 added several :class:`Treeview` features. The *selectmode* option "
"gained the values ``\"single\"`` and ``\"multiple\"``; the new widget "
"options *selecttype* (``\"item\"`` or ``\"cell\"`` selection), *striped* "
"(zebra-striped rows), and *titlecolumns* / *titleitems* (columns or rows "
"frozen against scrolling) were introduced; the column *separator* option was "
"added; and items gained a *hidden* option. Tk 9.1 added the *rowheight* and "
"*headingheight* options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:903
msgid "Item options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:905
msgid ""
"The following item options may be specified for items in the insert and item "
"widget commands."
msgstr ""
"Följande objektalternativ kan anges för objekt i kommandona insert och item "
"widget."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:913
msgid "The textual label to display for the item."
msgstr "Den textetikett som ska visas för objektet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:915
msgid "A Tk Image, displayed to the left of the label."
msgstr "En Tk-bild som visas till vänster om etiketten."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:917
msgid "The list of values associated with the item."
msgstr "Listan över värden som är kopplade till objektet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:919
msgid ""
"Each item should have the same number of values as the widget option "
"columns. If there are fewer values than columns, the remaining values are "
"assumed empty. If there are more values than columns, the extra values are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Varje objekt ska ha samma antal värden som widgetalternativets kolumner. Om "
"det finns färre värden än kolumner antas de återstående värdena vara tomma. "
"Om det finns fler värden än kolumner ignoreras de extra värdena."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:924
msgid "open"
msgstr "öppen"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:924
msgid ""
"``True``/``False`` value indicating whether the item's children should be "
"displayed or hidden."
msgstr ""
"``True``/``False`` värde som anger om objektets barn ska visas eller döljas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:927
msgid "tags"
msgstr "tags"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:927
msgid "A list of tags associated with this item."
msgstr "En lista över taggar som är associerade med detta objekt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:932
msgid "Tag options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:934
msgid "The following options may be specified on tags:"
msgstr "Följande alternativ kan anges för taggar:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:941
msgid "foreground"
msgstr "foreground"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:941
msgid "Specifies the text foreground color."
msgstr "Anger textens förgrundsfärg."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:943
msgid "Specifies the cell or item background color."
msgstr "Anger bakgrundsfärgen för cellen eller objektet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:945
msgid "font"
msgstr "font"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:945
msgid "Specifies the font to use when drawing text."
msgstr "Anger vilket teckensnitt som ska användas när du ritar text."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:947
msgid "Specifies the item image, in case the item's image option is empty."
msgstr "Anger artikelns bild, om artikelns bildalternativ är tomt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:953
msgid "Column identifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:955
msgid "Column identifiers take any of the following forms:"
msgstr "Kolumnidentifierare kan ha någon av följande former:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:957
msgid "A symbolic name from the list of columns option."
msgstr "Ett symboliskt namn från listan över kolumnalternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:958
msgid "An integer n, specifying the nth data column."
msgstr "Ett heltal n, som anger den n:te datakolumnen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:959
msgid ""
"A string of the form #n, where n is an integer, specifying the nth display "
"column."
msgstr ""
"En sträng av formen #n, där n är ett heltal, som anger den n:te "
"visningskolumnen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:962
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "Anteckningar:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:964
msgid ""
"Item's option values may be displayed in a different order than the order in "
"which they are stored."
msgstr ""
"Objektets optionsvärden kan visas i en annan ordning än den ordning i vilken "
"de lagras."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:966
msgid ""
"Column #0 always refers to the tree column, even if show=\"tree\" is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Kolumn #0 hänvisar alltid till trädkolumnen, även om show=\"tree\" inte har "
"angetts."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:969
msgid ""
"A data column number is an index into an item's option values list; a "
"display column number is the column number in the tree where the values are "
"displayed. Tree labels are displayed in column #0. If option displaycolumns "
"is not set, then data column n is displayed in column #n+1. Again, **column "
"#0 always refers to the tree column**."
msgstr ""
"Ett kolumnnummer för data är ett index i listan med alternativvärden för ett "
"objekt; ett kolumnnummer för visning är kolumnnumret i trädet där värdena "
"visas. Trädets etiketter visas i kolumn #0. Om alternativet displaycolumns "
"inte är inställt visas datakolumn n i kolumn #n+1. Återigen, **kolumn #0 "
"hänvisar alltid till trädkolumnen**."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:979
msgid "The Treeview widget generates the following virtual events."
msgstr "Widgeten Treeview genererar följande virtuella händelser."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:984
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Event"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:986
msgid "<<TreeviewSelect>>"
msgstr "<<TreeviewSelect>>"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:986
msgid "Generated whenever the selection changes."
msgstr "Genereras när urvalet ändras."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:988
msgid "<<TreeviewOpen>>"
msgstr "<<TreeviewOpen>>"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:988
msgid "Generated just before settings the focus item to open=True."
msgstr "Genereras precis innan fokusobjektet ställs in på open=True."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:991
msgid "<<TreeviewClose>>"
msgstr "<<TreeviewClose>>"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:991
msgid "Generated just after setting the focus item to open=False."
msgstr "Genereras precis efter att fokusobjektet har ställts in på open=False."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:995
msgid ""
"The :meth:`Treeview.focus` and :meth:`Treeview.selection` methods can be "
"used to determine the affected item or items."
msgstr ""
"Metoderna :meth:`Treeview.focus` och :meth:`Treeview.selection` kan användas "
"för att bestämma det eller de objekt som påverkas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1000
msgid "ttk.Treeview"
msgstr "ttk.Treeview"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1006
msgid ""
"Returns the bounding box (relative to the treeview widget's window) of the "
"specified *item* in the form (x, y, width, height)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar avgränsningsrutan (i förhållande till treeview-widgetens fönster) "
"för det angivna *objektet* i formen (x, y, bredd, höjd)."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1009
msgid ""
"If *column* is specified, returns the bounding box of that cell. If the "
"*item* is not visible (that is, if it is a descendant of a closed item or is "
"scrolled offscreen), returns an empty string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1013 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1720
msgid ""
"This shadows the inherited :meth:`!Misc.bbox`; use :meth:`~tkinter.Misc."
"grid_bbox` for the grid bounding box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1019
msgid "Returns a tuple of children belonging to *item*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1021
msgid "If *item* is not specified, returns root children."
msgstr "Om *item* inte anges returneras rotbarn."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1026
msgid "Replaces *item*'s children with *newchildren*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1028
msgid ""
"Children present in *item* that are not present in *newchildren* are "
"detached from the tree. No items in *newchildren* may be an ancestor of "
"*item*. Note that not specifying *newchildren* results in detaching *item*'s "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Barn som finns i *item* och som inte finns i *newchildren* tas bort från "
"trädet. Inga objekt i *newchildren* får vara förfäder till *item*. Observera "
"att om du inte anger *newchildren* kommer *item*:s barn att tas bort."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1036
msgid "Query or modify the options for the specified *column*."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra alternativen för den angivna *kolumnen*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1038
msgid ""
"If *kw* is not given, returns a dict of the column option values. If "
"*option* is specified then the value for that *option* is returned. "
"Otherwise, sets the options to the corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"Om *kw* inte anges, returneras en dict med värden för kolumnens alternativ. "
"Om *option* anges returneras värdet för det *option*. Annars sätts "
"alternativen till motsvarande värden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1042 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1104
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1652
msgid "The valid options/values are:"
msgstr "De giltiga alternativen/värdena är:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1044
msgid "*id*"
msgstr "*id*"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1045
msgid "Returns the column name. This is a read-only option."
msgstr "Returnerar kolumnnamnet. Detta är ett skrivskyddat alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1046
msgid "*anchor*: One of the standard Tk anchor values."
msgstr "*anchor*: Ett av Tk:s standardvärden för ankare."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1047
msgid ""
"Specifies how the text in this column should be aligned with respect to the "
"cell."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur texten i den här kolumnen ska justeras i förhållande till cellen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1049
msgid "*minwidth*: width"
msgstr "*minwidth*: bredd"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1050
msgid ""
"The minimum width of the column in pixels. The treeview widget will not make "
"the column any smaller than specified by this option when the widget is "
"resized or the user drags a column."
msgstr ""
"Kolumnens minsta bredd i pixlar. Treeview-widgeten kommer inte att göra "
"kolumnen mindre än vad som anges av detta alternativ när widgeten ändras i "
"storlek eller användaren drar en kolumn."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1053
msgid "*separator*: ``True``/``False``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1054
msgid ""
"Specifies whether a column separator should be drawn to the right of the "
"column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1056
msgid "*stretch*: ``True``/``False``"
msgstr "*stretch*: ``True``/`False``"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1057
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the column's width should be adjusted when the widget is "
"resized."
msgstr "Anger om kolumnens bredd ska justeras när widgetens storlek ändras."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1059
msgid "*width*: width"
msgstr "*width*: bredd"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1060
msgid "The width of the column in pixels."
msgstr "Kolumnens bredd i pixlar."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1062
msgid "To configure the tree column, call this with column = \"#0\""
msgstr "För att konfigurera trädkolumnen, kalla detta med column = \"#0\""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1066
msgid "Delete all specified *items* and all their descendants."
msgstr "Ta bort alla angivna *objekt* och alla deras efterföljande objekt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1068
msgid "The root item may not be deleted."
msgstr "Rotobjektet får inte raderas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1073
msgid "Unlinks all of the specified *items* from the tree."
msgstr "Avlänk alla angivna *objekt* från trädet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1075
msgid ""
"The items and all of their descendants are still present, and may be "
"reinserted at another point in the tree, but will not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Objekten och alla deras ättlingar finns fortfarande kvar och kan återinföras "
"på en annan plats i trädet, men de visas inte."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1078
msgid "The root item may not be detached."
msgstr "Rotposten får inte lossas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1083
msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the specified *item* is present in the tree, ``False`` "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1089
msgid ""
"If *item* is specified, sets the focus item to *item*. Otherwise, returns "
"the current focus item, or '' if there is none."
msgstr ""
"Om *item* anges, sätts fokusobjektet till *item*. I annat fall returneras "
"det aktuella fokusobjektet, eller '' om det inte finns något."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1092
msgid ""
"This shadows the inherited :meth:`!Misc.focus`; use :meth:`~tkinter.Misc."
"focus_set` to focus the widget itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1098
msgid "Query or modify the heading options for the specified *column*."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra rubrikalternativen för den angivna *kolumnen*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1100
msgid ""
"If *kw* is not given, returns a dict of the heading option values. If "
"*option* is specified then the value for that *option* is returned. "
"Otherwise, sets the options to the corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"Om *kw* inte anges, returneras en dict med rubrikens alternativvärden. Om "
"*option* anges returneras värdet för det *option*. Annars sätts alternativen "
"till motsvarande värden."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1106
msgid "*text*: text"
msgstr "*text*: text"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1107
msgid "The text to display in the column heading."
msgstr "Den text som ska visas i kolumnrubriken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1108
msgid "*image*: imageName"
msgstr "*image*: imageName"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1109
msgid "Specifies an image to display to the right of the column heading."
msgstr "Anger en bild som ska visas till höger om kolumnrubriken."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1110
msgid "*anchor*: anchor"
msgstr "*anchor*: ankare"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1111
msgid ""
"Specifies how the heading text should be aligned. One of the standard Tk "
"anchor values."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur rubriktexten ska justeras. Ett av Tk:s standardvärden för ankare."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1113
msgid "*command*: callback"
msgstr "*kommando*: återuppringning"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1114
msgid "A callback to be invoked when the heading label is pressed."
msgstr "En återuppringning som aktiveras när rubriketiketten trycks in."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1116
msgid "To configure the tree column heading, call this with column = \"#0\"."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera trädets kolumnrubrik, kalla detta med column = \"#0\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1121
msgid ""
"Returns a description of the specified *component* under the point given by "
"*x* and *y*, or the empty string if no such *component* is present at that "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en beskrivning av den angivna *komponenten* under den punkt som "
"anges av *x* och *y*, eller den tomma strängen om ingen sådan *komponent* "
"finns vid den positionen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1128
msgid "Returns the item ID of the item at position *y*."
msgstr "Returnerar artikel-ID för artikeln på position *y*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1133
msgid "Returns the display column identifier of the cell at position *x*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1135
msgid "The tree column has ID #0."
msgstr "Trädkolonnen har ID #0."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1140
msgid "Returns one of:"
msgstr "Returnerar en av:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1143
msgid "region"
msgstr "region"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1143
msgid "meaning"
msgstr "betydelse"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1145
msgid "heading"
msgstr "rubriknivå"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1145
msgid "Tree heading area."
msgstr "Trädhuvudområde."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1147
msgid "separator"
msgstr "avdelare"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1147
msgid "Space between two columns headings."
msgstr "Mellanslag mellan två kolumners rubriker."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1149
msgid "tree"
msgstr "träd"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1149
msgid "The tree area."
msgstr "Trädområdet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1151
msgid "cell"
msgstr "cell"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1151
msgid "A data cell."
msgstr "En datacell."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1154 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1161
msgid "Availability: Tk 8.6."
msgstr "Tillgänglighet: Tk 8.6."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1159
msgid "Returns the element at position *x*, *y*."
msgstr "Returnerar elementet på position *x*, *y*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1166
msgid ""
"Returns the integer index of *item* within its parent's list of children."
msgstr "Returnerar heltalsindexet för *item* i dess förälders lista över barn."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1171
msgid ""
"Creates a new item and returns the item identifier of the newly created item."
msgstr ""
"Skapar en ny artikel och returnerar artikelidentifieraren för den nyskapade "
"artikeln."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1174
msgid ""
"*parent* is the item ID of the parent item, or the empty string to create a "
"new top-level item. *index* is an integer, or the value \"end\", specifying "
"where in the list of parent's children to insert the new item. If *index* is "
"less than or equal to zero, the new node is inserted at the beginning; if "
"*index* is greater than or equal to the current number of children, it is "
"inserted at the end. If *iid* is specified, it is used as the item "
"identifier; *iid* must not already exist in the tree. Otherwise, a new "
"unique identifier is generated."
msgstr ""
"*parent* är artikel-ID för den överordnade artikeln, eller den tomma "
"strängen för att skapa en ny artikel på högsta nivån. *index* är ett heltal, "
"eller värdet \"end\", som anger var i listan över förälderns barn som det "
"nya objektet ska infogas. Om *index* är mindre än eller lika med noll "
"infogas den nya noden i början; om *index* är större än eller lika med det "
"aktuella antalet barn infogas den i slutet. Om *iid* anges används det som "
"objektets identifierare; *iid* får inte redan finnas i trädet. Annars "
"genereras en ny unik identifierare."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1183
msgid "See `Item Options`_ for the list of available options."
msgstr "Se `Item Options`_ för en lista över tillgängliga alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1188
msgid "Query or modify the options for the specified *item*."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra alternativen för den angivna *artikeln*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1190
msgid ""
"If no options are given, a dict with options/values for the item is "
"returned. If *option* is specified then the value for that option is "
"returned. Otherwise, sets the options to the corresponding values as given "
"by *kw*."
msgstr ""
"Om inga alternativ anges returneras en dikt med alternativ/värden för "
"objektet. Om *option* anges returneras värdet för det alternativet. I annat "
"fall sätts alternativen till motsvarande värden som anges av *kw*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1201
msgid "Moves *item* to position *index* in *parent*'s list of children."
msgstr "Flyttar *item* till position *index* i *parent*:s lista över barn."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1203
msgid ""
"It is illegal to move an item under one of its descendants. If *index* is "
"less than or equal to zero, *item* is moved to the beginning; if greater "
"than or equal to the number of children, it is moved to the end. If *item* "
"was detached it is reattached."
msgstr ""
"Det är olagligt att flytta ett objekt under en av dess ättlingar. Om *index* "
"är mindre än eller lika med noll flyttas *objektet* till början; om det är "
"större än eller lika med antalet barn flyttas det till slutet. Om *item* var "
"fristående fästs det på nytt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1208
msgid ":meth:`reattach` is an alias of :meth:`!move`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1213
msgid ""
"Returns the identifier of *item*'s next sibling, or '' if *item* is the last "
"child of its parent."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar identifieraren för *item*:s nästa syskon, eller '' om *item* är "
"det sista barnet till sin förälder."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1219
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the parent of *item*, or '' if *item* is at the top level "
"of the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar ID för föräldern till *item*, eller '' om *item* är på den "
"översta nivån i hierarkin."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1225
msgid ""
"Returns the identifier of *item*'s previous sibling, or '' if *item* is the "
"first child of its parent."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar identifieraren för *item*:s föregående syskon, eller '' om *item* "
"är det första barnet till sin förälder."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1231
msgid "Ensure that *item* is visible."
msgstr "Se till att *item* är synligt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1233
msgid ""
"Sets all of *item*'s ancestors open option to ``True``, and scrolls the "
"widget if necessary so that *item* is within the visible portion of the tree."
msgstr ""
"Ställer in alla *item*s förfäders öppna alternativ till ``True``, och "
"scrollar widgeten om det behövs så att *item* är inom den synliga delen av "
"trädet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1240
msgid "Returns a tuple of selected items."
msgstr "Returnerar en tupel av valda objekt."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1242
msgid ""
"``selection()`` no longer takes arguments.  For changing the selection state "
"use the following selection methods."
msgstr ""
"``selection()`` tar inte längre emot argument.  Använd följande "
"urvalsmetoder för att ändra urvalstillståndet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1249
msgid "*items* becomes the new selection."
msgstr "*items* blir det nya urvalet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1251 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1259
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1267 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1275
msgid ""
"*items* can be passed as separate arguments, not just as a single tuple."
msgstr ""
"*items* kan skickas som separata argument, inte bara som en enda tupel."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1257
msgid "Add *items* to the selection."
msgstr "Lägg till *artiklar* i urvalet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1265
msgid "Remove *items* from the selection."
msgstr "Ta bort *objekt* från urvalet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1273
msgid "Toggle the selection state of each item in *items*."
msgstr "Växla valstatus för varje objekt i *items*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1281
msgid ""
"With one argument, returns a dictionary of column/value pairs for the "
"specified *item*. With two arguments, returns the current value of the "
"specified *column*. With three arguments, sets the value of given *column* "
"in given *item* to the specified *value*."
msgstr ""
"Med ett argument returneras en ordbok med kolumn/värde-par för den angivna "
"*artikeln*. Med två argument returneras det aktuella värdet för den angivna "
"*kolumnen*. Med tre argument, anger värdet för angiven *kolumn* i angiven "
"*artikel* till angivet *värde*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1289
msgid ""
"Bind a callback for the given event *sequence* to the tag *tagname*. When an "
"event is delivered to an item, the callbacks for each of the item's tags "
"option are called."
msgstr ""
"Binder ett callback för den angivna händelsen *sequence* till taggen "
"*tagname*. När en händelse levereras till ett objekt anropas "
"återuppringningarna för vart och ett av objektets taggalternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1296
msgid "Query or modify the options for the specified *tagname*."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra alternativen för det angivna *tagnamnet*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1298
msgid ""
"If *kw* is not given, returns a dict of the option settings for *tagname*. "
"If *option* is specified, returns the value for that *option* for the "
"specified *tagname*. Otherwise, sets the options to the corresponding values "
"for the given *tagname*."
msgstr ""
"Om *kw* inte anges, returneras en dict med alternativinställningarna för "
"*tagname*. Om *option* anges, returneras värdet för det *option* för det "
"angivna *tagname*. I annat fall sätts alternativen till motsvarande värden "
"för det angivna *tagname*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1306
msgid ""
"If *item* is specified, returns ``True`` if the specified *item* has the "
"given *tagname* and ``False`` otherwise. Otherwise, returns a tuple of all "
"items that have the specified tag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1310
msgid "Availability: Tk 8.6"
msgstr "Tillgänglighet: Tk 8,6"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1315
msgid "Query or modify horizontal position of the treeview."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra trädvyens horisontella position."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1320
msgid "Query or modify vertical position of the treeview."
msgstr "Fråga efter eller ändra trädvyns vertikala position."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1326
msgid "Ttk styling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1328
msgid ""
"Each widget in :mod:`!ttk` is assigned a style, which specifies the set of "
"elements making up the widget and how they are arranged, along with dynamic "
"and default settings for element options. By default the style name is the "
"same as the widget's class name, but it may be overridden by the widget's "
"style option. If you don't know the class name of a widget, use the method :"
"meth:`Misc.winfo_class <tkinter.Misc.winfo_class>` (somewidget."
"winfo_class())."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1338
msgid ""
"`Introduction to the Tk theme engine <https://www.tcl-lang.org/man/tcl9.0/"
"TkCmd/ttk_intro.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1339
msgid "The ``ttk::intro`` man page explains how the theme engine works."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1341
msgid ""
"`The Tile Widget Set <https://tktable.sourceforge.net/tile/tile-tcl2004."
"pdf>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1342
msgid ""
"Joe English's 2004 paper introducing the theme engine (then the separate "
"*Tile* extension), with diagrams of how elements and layouts make up a "
"widget's appearance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1349
msgid "This class is used to manipulate the style database."
msgstr "Denna klass används för att manipulera stildatabasen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1354
msgid "Query or set the default value of the specified option(s) in *style*."
msgstr ""
"Fråga efter eller ange standardvärdet för det eller de angivna alternativen "
"i *style*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1356
msgid ""
"Each key in *kw* is an option and each value is a string identifying the "
"value for that option."
msgstr ""
"Varje nyckel i *kw* är ett alternativ och varje värde är en sträng som "
"identifierar värdet för det alternativet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1359
msgid ""
"For example, to change every default button to be a flat button with some "
"padding and a different background color::"
msgstr ""
"Om du t.ex. vill ändra alla standardknappar till en platt knapp med lite "
"utfyllnad och en annan bakgrundsfärg::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1362
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"ttk.Style().configure(\"TButton\", padding=6, relief=\"flat\",\n"
"   background=\"#ccc\")\n"
"\n"
"btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Sample\")\n"
"btn.pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"från tkinter importera ttk\n"
"importera tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"ttk.Style().configure(\"TButton\", padding=6, relief=\"flat\",\n"
"   bakgrund=\"#ccc\")\n"
"\n"
"btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Prov\")\n"
"btn.pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1378
msgid "Query or sets dynamic values of the specified option(s) in *style*."
msgstr ""
"Frågar efter eller anger dynamiska värden för det eller de angivna "
"alternativen i *style*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1380
msgid ""
"Each key in *kw* is an option and each value should be a list or a tuple "
"(usually) containing statespecs grouped in tuples, lists, or some other "
"preference. A statespec is a compound of one or more states and then a value."
msgstr ""
"Varje nyckel i *kw* är ett alternativ och varje värde ska vara en lista "
"eller en tupel (vanligtvis) som innehåller statespecs grupperade i tuplar, "
"listor eller någon annan preferens. En statespec är en sammansättning av ett "
"eller flera tillstånd och sedan ett värde."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1385
msgid "An example may make it more understandable::"
msgstr "Ett exempel kan göra det mer begripligt::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1387
msgid ""
"import tkinter\n"
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.map(\"C.TButton\",\n"
"    foreground=[('pressed', 'red'), ('active', 'blue')],\n"
"    background=[('pressed', '!disabled', 'black'), ('active', 'white')]\n"
"    )\n"
"\n"
"colored_btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Test\", style=\"C.TButton\").pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"importera tkinter\n"
"från tkinter importera ttk\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.map(\"C.TButton\",\n"
"    foreground=[('pressed', 'red'), ('active', 'blue')],\n"
"    background=[('pressed', '!disabled', 'black'), ('active', 'white')]\n"
"    )\n"
"\n"
"colored_btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Test\", style=\"C.TButton\").pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1403
msgid ""
"Note that the order of the (states, value) sequences for an option does "
"matter, if the order is changed to ``[('active', 'blue'), ('pressed', "
"'red')]`` in the foreground option, for example, the result would be a blue "
"foreground when the widget were in active or pressed states."
msgstr ""
"Observera att ordningen på sekvenserna (tillstånd, värde) för ett alternativ "
"har betydelse. Om ordningen ändras till ``[('active', 'blue'), ('pressed', "
"'red')]`` i alternativet för förgrund, till exempel, skulle resultatet bli "
"en blå förgrund när widgeten var i aktivt eller pressat tillstånd."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1408
msgid ""
"When called to query the map (without specifying values to set), it returns "
"a dictionary mapping each option to its list of statespecs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1411
msgid "The value returned when querying the map was corrected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1417
msgid "Returns the value specified for *option* in *style*."
msgstr "Returnerar det värde som anges för *option* i *style*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1419
msgid ""
"If *state* is specified, it is expected to be a sequence of one or more "
"states. If the *default* argument is set, it is used as a fallback value in "
"case no specification for option is found."
msgstr ""
"Om *state* anges förväntas det vara en sekvens av ett eller flera tillstånd. "
"Om argumentet *default* anges används det som ett reservvärde om ingen "
"specifikation för optionen hittas."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1423
msgid "To check what font a Button uses by default::"
msgstr ""
"Så här kontrollerar du vilket teckensnitt en knapp använder som standard::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1425
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"print(ttk.Style().lookup(\"TButton\", \"font\"))"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"print(ttk.Style().lookup(\"TButton\", \"font\"))"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1432
msgid ""
"Define the widget layout for given *style*. If *layoutspec* is omitted, "
"return the layout specification for given style."
msgstr ""
"Definiera widgetlayouten för given *style*. Om *layoutspec* utelämnas "
"returneras layoutspecifikationen för den givna stilen."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1435
msgid ""
"*layoutspec*, if specified, is expected to be a list or some other sequence "
"type (excluding strings), where each item should be a tuple and the first "
"item is the layout name and the second item should have the format described "
"in `Layouts`_."
msgstr ""
"*layoutspec*, om den anges, förväntas vara en lista eller någon annan "
"sekvenstyp (exklusive strängar), där varje objekt ska vara en tupel och det "
"första objektet är layoutnamnet och det andra objektet ska ha det format som "
"beskrivs i `Layouts`_."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1440
msgid ""
"To understand the format, see the following example (it is not intended to "
"do anything useful)::"
msgstr ""
"För att förstå formatet, se följande exempel (det är inte meningen att det "
"ska göra något användbart)::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1443
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.layout(\"TMenubutton\", [\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.background\", None),\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.button\", {\"children\":\n"
"       [(\"Menubutton.focus\", {\"children\":\n"
"           [(\"Menubutton.padding\", {\"children\":\n"
"               [(\"Menubutton.label\", {\"side\": \"left\", \"expand\": "
"1})]\n"
"           })]\n"
"       })]\n"
"   }),\n"
"])\n"
"\n"
"mbtn = ttk.Menubutton(text='Text')\n"
"mbtn.pack()\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.layout(\"TMenubutton\", [\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.background\", None),\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.button\", {\"children\":\n"
"       [(\"Menubutton.focus\", {\"children\":\n"
"           [(\"Menubutton.padding\", {\"children\":\n"
"               [(\"Menubutton.label\", {\"side\": \"left\", \"expand\": "
"1})]\n"
"           })]\n"
"       })]\n"
"   }),\n"
"])\n"
"\n"
"mbtn = ttk.Menubutton(text='Text')\n"
"mbtn.pack()\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1467
msgid ""
"Create a new element in the current theme, of the given *etype* which is "
"expected to be either \"image\", \"from\" or \"vsapi\". The latter is only "
"available in Tk 8.6 on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Skapar ett nytt element i det aktuella temat, av den angivna *etypen* som "
"förväntas vara antingen \"image\", \"from\" eller \"vsapi\". Den senare är "
"endast tillgänglig i Tk 8.6 på Windows."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1471
msgid ""
"If \"image\" is used, *args* should contain the default image name followed "
"by statespec/value pairs (this is the imagespec), and *kw* may have the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Om \"image\" används ska *args* innehålla standardbildnamnet följt av paren "
"statespec/värde (detta är imagespec), och *kw* kan ha följande alternativ:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1475
msgid "border=padding"
msgstr "border=fyllnad"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1476
msgid ""
"padding is a list of up to four integers, specifying the left, top, right, "
"and bottom borders, respectively."
msgstr ""
"padding är en lista med upp till fyra heltal som anger vänster-, topp-, "
"höger- respektive bottenkanter."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1479 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1553
msgid "height=height"
msgstr "höjd=höjd"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1480
msgid ""
"Specifies a minimum height for the element. If less than zero, the base "
"image's height is used as a default."
msgstr ""
"Anger en minsta höjd för elementet. Om den är mindre än noll används "
"basbildens höjd som standard."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1483 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1527
msgid "padding=padding"
msgstr "utfyllnad=utfyllnad"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1484
msgid ""
"Specifies the element's interior padding. Defaults to border's value if not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Anger elementets invändiga utfyllnad. Standardvärdet är border-värdet om det "
"inte anges."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1487
msgid "sticky=spec"
msgstr "sticky=spec"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1488
msgid ""
"Specifies how the image is placed within the final parcel. spec contains "
"zero or more characters \"n\", \"s\", \"w\", or \"e\"."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur bilden ska placeras i det slutliga paketet. spec innehåller noll "
"eller flera tecken \"n\", \"s\", \"w\" eller \"e\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1491 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1545
msgid "width=width"
msgstr "width=bredd"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1492
msgid ""
"Specifies a minimum width for the element. If less than zero, the base "
"image's width is used as a default."
msgstr ""
"Anger en minsta bredd för elementet. Om den är mindre än noll används "
"basbildens bredd som standard."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1495 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1512
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1557
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Exempel::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1497
msgid ""
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-pressed.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-active.png')\n"
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('Button.button', 'image',\n"
"                     img1, ('pressed', img2), ('active', img3),\n"
"                     border=(2, 4), sticky='we')"
msgstr ""
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-pressed.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-active.png')\n"
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('Button.button', 'image',\n"
"                     img1, ('pressed', img2), ('active', img3),\n"
"                     border=(2, 4), sticky='we')"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1505
msgid ""
"If \"from\" is used as the value of *etype*, :meth:`element_create` will "
"clone an existing element. *args* is expected to contain a themename, from "
"which the element will be cloned, and optionally an element to clone from. "
"If this element to clone from is not specified, an empty element will be "
"used. *kw* is discarded."
msgstr ""
"Om \"from\" används som värde för *etype*, kommer :meth:`element_create` att "
"klona ett befintligt element. *args* förväntas innehålla ett temanamn, från "
"vilket elementet ska klonas, och eventuellt ett element att klona från. Om "
"elementet att klona från inte anges, kommer ett tomt element att användas. "
"*kw* kastas bort."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1514
msgid ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('plain.background', 'from', 'default')"
msgstr ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('plain.background', 'from', 'default')"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1517
msgid ""
"If \"vsapi\" is used as the value of *etype*, :meth:`element_create` will "
"create a new element in the current theme whose visual appearance is drawn "
"using the Microsoft Visual Styles API which is responsible for the themed "
"styles on Windows XP and Vista. *args* is expected to contain the Visual "
"Styles class and part as given in the Microsoft documentation followed by an "
"optional sequence of tuples of ttk states and the corresponding Visual "
"Styles API state value. *kw* may have the following options:"
msgstr ""
"Om \"vsapi\" används som värde för *etype* kommer :meth:`element_create` att "
"skapa ett nytt element i det aktuella temat vars visuella utseende ritas med "
"hjälp av Microsoft Visual Styles API som ansvarar för temastilarna i Windows "
"XP och Vista. *args* förväntas innehålla Visual Styles-klassen och -delen "
"som anges i Microsoft-dokumentationen följt av en valfri sekvens av tuples "
"av ttk-tillstånd och motsvarande Visual Styles API-tillståndsvärde. *kw* kan "
"ha följande alternativ:"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1528
msgid ""
"Specify the element's interior padding. *padding* is a list of up to four "
"integers specifying the left, top, right and bottom padding quantities "
"respectively. If fewer than four elements are specified, bottom defaults to "
"top, right defaults to left, and top defaults to left. In other words, a "
"list of three numbers specify the left, vertical, and right padding; a list "
"of two numbers specify the horizontal and the vertical padding; a single "
"number specifies the same padding all the way around the widget. This option "
"may not be mixed with any other options."
msgstr ""
"Ange elementets inre utfyllnad. *padding* är en lista med upp till fyra "
"heltal som anger vänster-, topp-, höger- respektive bottenfyllnadsmängderna. "
"Om färre än fyra element anges är botten standardvärdet för topp, höger "
"standardvärdet för vänster och topp standardvärdet för vänster. Med andra "
"ord anger en lista med tre tal vänster, vertikal och höger utfyllnad; en "
"lista med två tal anger horisontell och vertikal utfyllnad; ett enda tal "
"anger samma utfyllnad hela vägen runt widgeten. Detta alternativ får inte "
"blandas med några andra alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1539
msgid "margins=padding"
msgstr "marginaler=utfyllnad"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1540
msgid ""
"Specifies the elements exterior padding. *padding* is a list of up to four "
"integers specifying the left, top, right and bottom padding quantities "
"respectively. This option may not be mixed with any other options."
msgstr ""
"Anger elementens yttre utfyllnad. *padding* är en lista med upp till fyra "
"heltal som anger vänster-, topp-, höger- respektive bottenfyllnadsmängderna. "
"Detta alternativ får inte blandas med några andra alternativ."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1546
msgid ""
"Specifies the width for the element. If this option is set then the Visual "
"Styles API will not be queried for the recommended size or the part. If this "
"option is set then *height* should also be set. The *width* and *height* "
"options cannot be mixed with the *padding* or *margins* options."
msgstr ""
"Anger bredden för elementet. Om det här alternativet anges kommer Visual "
"Styles API inte att tillfrågas om rekommenderad storlek eller del. Om detta "
"alternativ anges bör även *height* anges. Alternativen *width* och *height* "
"kan inte blandas med alternativen *padding* eller *margins*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1554
msgid "Specifies the height of the element. See the comments for *width*."
msgstr "Anger elementets höjd. Se kommentarerna för *width*."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1559
msgid ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('pin', 'vsapi', 'EXPLORERBAR', 3, [\n"
"                     ('pressed', '!selected', 3),\n"
"                     ('active', '!selected', 2),\n"
"                     ('pressed', 'selected', 6),\n"
"                     ('active', 'selected', 5),\n"
"                     ('selected', 4),\n"
"                     ('', 1)])\n"
"style.layout('Explorer.Pin',\n"
"             [('Explorer.Pin.pin', {'sticky': 'news'})])\n"
"pin = ttk.Checkbutton(style='Explorer.Pin')\n"
"pin.pack(expand=True, fill='both')"
msgstr ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('pin', 'vsapi', 'EXPLORERBAR', 3, [\n"
"                     ('pressed', '!selected', 3),\n"
"                     ('active', '!selected', 2),\n"
"                     ('pressed', 'selected', 6),\n"
"                     ('active', 'selected', 5),\n"
"                     ('selected', 4),\n"
"                     ('', 1)])\n"
"style.layout('Explorer.Pin',\n"
"             [('Explorer.Pin.pin', {'sticky': 'news'})])\n"
"pin = ttk.Checkbutton(style='Explorer.Pin')\n"
"pin.pack(expand=True, fill='both')"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1572
msgid "Added support of the \"vsapi\" element factory."
msgstr "Lagt till stöd för elementfabriken \"vsapi\"."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1577
msgid "Returns a tuple of elements defined in the current theme."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1582
msgid "Returns a tuple of *elementname*'s options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1587
msgid "Create a new theme."
msgstr "Skapa ett nytt tema."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1589
msgid ""
"It is an error if *themename* already exists. If *parent* is specified, the "
"new theme will inherit styles, elements and layouts from the parent theme. "
"If *settings* are present they are expected to have the same syntax used "
"for :meth:`theme_settings`."
msgstr ""
"Det är ett fel om *themename* redan finns. Om *parent* anges kommer det nya "
"temat att ärva stilar, element och layouter från föräldratemat. Om "
"*settings* finns med förväntas de ha samma syntax som används för :meth:"
"`theme_settings`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1597
msgid ""
"Temporarily sets the current theme to *themename*, apply specified "
"*settings* and then restore the previous theme."
msgstr ""
"Ställer tillfälligt in det aktuella temat på *themename*, tillämpar angivna "
"*settings* och återställer sedan det tidigare temat."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1600
msgid ""
"Each key in *settings* is a style and each value may contain the keys "
"'configure', 'map', 'layout' and 'element create' and they are expected to "
"have the same format as specified by the methods :meth:`Style.configure`, :"
"meth:`Style.map`, :meth:`Style.layout` and :meth:`Style.element_create` "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"Varje nyckel i *settings* är en stil och varje värde kan innehålla nycklarna "
"'configure', 'map', 'layout' och 'element create' och de förväntas ha samma "
"format som anges av metoderna :meth:`Style.configure`, :meth:`Style.map`, :"
"meth:`Style.layout` respektive :meth:`Style.element_create`."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1606
msgid "As an example, let's change the Combobox for the default theme a bit::"
msgstr "Som ett exempel, låt oss ändra Combobox för standardtemat lite::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1608
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.theme_settings(\"default\", {\n"
"   \"TCombobox\": {\n"
"       \"configure\": {\"padding\": 5},\n"
"       \"map\": {\n"
"           \"background\": [(\"active\", \"green2\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"green4\")],\n"
"           \"fieldbackground\": [(\"!disabled\", \"green3\")],\n"
"           \"foreground\": [(\"focus\", \"OliveDrab1\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"OliveDrab2\")]\n"
"       }\n"
"   }\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"combo = ttk.Combobox().pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.theme_settings(\"default\", {\n"
"   \"TCombobox\": {\n"
"       \"configure\": {\"padding\": 5},\n"
"       \"map\": {\n"
"           \"background\": [(\"active\", \"green2\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"green4\")],\n"
"           \"fieldbackground\": [(\"!disabled\", \"green3\")],\n"
"           \"foreground\": [(\"focus\", \"OliveDrab1\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"OliveDrab2\")]\n"
"       }\n"
"   }\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"combo = ttk.Combobox().pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1634
msgid "Returns a tuple of all known themes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1639
msgid ""
"If *themename* is not given, returns the theme in use.  Otherwise, sets the "
"current theme to *themename*, refreshes all widgets and emits a "
"<<ThemeChanged>> event."
msgstr ""
"Om *themename* inte anges returneras det tema som används.  I annat fall "
"ställs det aktuella temat in på *themename*, alla widgetar uppdateras och en "
"&lt;<ThemeChanged>&gt;-händelse skickas ut."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1645
msgid "Layouts"
msgstr "Layouter"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1647
msgid ""
"A layout can be just ``None``, if it takes no options, or a dict of options "
"specifying how to arrange the element. The layout mechanism uses a "
"simplified version of the pack geometry manager: given an initial cavity, "
"each element is allocated a parcel."
msgstr ""
"En layout kan vara bara ``None``, om den inte tar några alternativ, eller en "
"dikt av alternativ som anger hur elementet ska arrangeras. Layoutmekanismen "
"använder en förenklad version av packgeometrihanteraren: givet en initial "
"hålighet tilldelas varje element ett paket."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1654
msgid "*side*: whichside"
msgstr "*sida*: vilken sida"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1655
msgid ""
"Specifies which side of the cavity to place the element; one of top, right, "
"bottom or left. If omitted, the element occupies the entire cavity."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilken sida av hålrummet som elementet ska placeras på; en av topp, "
"höger, botten eller vänster. Om detta utelämnas upptar elementet hela "
"hålrummet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1659
msgid "*sticky*: nswe"
msgstr "*sticky*: nswe"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1660
msgid "Specifies where the element is placed inside its allocated parcel."
msgstr "Anger var elementet placeras inom det tilldelade paketet."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1662
msgid "*unit*: 0 or 1"
msgstr "*unit*: 0 eller 1"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1663
msgid ""
"If set to 1, causes the element and all of its descendants to be treated as "
"a single element for the purposes of :meth:`Widget.identify` et al. It's "
"used for things like scrollbar thumbs with grips."
msgstr ""
"Om inställningen är 1, behandlas elementet och alla dess ättlingar som ett "
"enda element i :meth:`Widget.identify` och liknande. Det används för saker "
"som rullningslister med tummar och grepp."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1667
msgid "*children*: [sublayout... ]"
msgstr "*children*: [underlayout... ]"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1668
msgid ""
"Specifies a list of elements to place inside the element. Each element is a "
"tuple (or other sequence type) where the first item is the layout name, and "
"the other is a `Layout`_."
msgstr ""
"Anger en lista med element som ska placeras inuti elementet. Varje element "
"är en tupel (eller annan sekvenstyp) där det första objektet är layoutnamnet "
"och det andra är en `Layout`_."

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1676
msgid "Additional widgets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1678
msgid ""
"The following themed widgets complete the :mod:`tkinter.ttk` widget set. "
"Each is the themed counterpart of the like-named classic :mod:`tkinter` "
"widget and inherits the common methods of :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1684
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Button` widget, displays a textual label and/or image, and "
"evaluates a command when pressed. It is the themed counterpart of :class:"
"`tkinter.Button` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1691
msgid "Invoke the command associated with the button and return its result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1696
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Checkbutton` widget, used to control a boolean variable that is "
"toggled on and off. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"Checkbutton` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1703
msgid ""
"Toggle the button between its selected and deselected states, invoke the "
"command associated with the button, and return its result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1709
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Entry` widget, displays a one-line text string and allows the "
"user to edit it. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Entry` and "
"inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget` as well as the "
"editing methods from :class:`tkinter.Entry`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1717
msgid ""
"Return a tuple ``(x, y, width, height)`` giving the bounding box of the "
"character at the given *index*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1725
msgid ""
"Return the name of the element under the point given by *x* and *y*, or the "
"empty string if no element is present at that location."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1730
msgid ""
"Force validation of the entry and return ``True`` if validation succeeded, "
"and ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1736
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Frame` widget, a container used to group and lay out other "
"widgets. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Frame` and inherits "
"the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1744
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Label` widget, displays a textual label and/or image. It is the "
"themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Label` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1751
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Labelframe` widget, a container that draws a border and a title "
"label around its contents. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"LabelFrame` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1759
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Menubutton` widget, displays a textual label and/or image, and "
"pops up a menu when pressed. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"Menubutton` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1767
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`OptionMenu` widget, a :class:`Menubutton` that pops up a menu of "
"mutually exclusive choices. *variable* is the variable that tracks the "
"currently selected value, *default* is the value to set initially, and "
"*values* are the entries to display in the menu. A *command* keyword "
"argument may be given to specify a callable that is invoked with the "
"selected value whenever the selection changes; the *style* keyword argument "
"sets the style used by the underlying menubutton; and the *direction* "
"keyword argument sets where the menu is posted relative to the menubutton "
"(one of ``'above'``, ``'below'`` (the default), ``'left'``, ``'right'`` or "
"``'flush'``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1781
msgid ""
"Replace the entries of the menu with *values*. If *default* is given, also "
"set it as the current value of the *variable*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1787
msgid "Destroy this widget and its associated menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1793
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Panedwindow` widget, displays a number of subwindows stacked "
"either vertically or horizontally. The user may adjust the relative sizes of "
"the subwindows by dragging the sash between panes. It is the themed "
"counterpart of :class:`tkinter.PanedWindow` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`, as well as the :meth:`!add` and :meth:`!panes` "
"methods from :class:`tkinter.PanedWindow`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1803
msgid ""
"Insert a pane containing *child* at the position *pos*. *pos* is either the "
"string ``'end'``, an integer index, or the name of a managed subwindow. If "
"*child* is already managed by the paned window, move it to the specified "
"position. Any keyword arguments set pane options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1812
msgid ""
"Remove *child*, which may be either an integer index or the name of a "
"managed subwindow, from the panes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1822
msgid ""
"Query or modify the options of the specified *pane*, where *pane* is either "
"an integer index or the name of a managed subwindow. If no arguments are "
"given, return a dictionary of the pane option values. If *option* is "
"specified, return the value of that option. Otherwise, set the options given "
"as keyword arguments to their corresponding values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1831
msgid ""
"If *newpos* is specified, set the position of sash number *index* and return "
"its new position. This may adjust the positions of adjacent sashes to ensure "
"that positions are monotonically increasing; positions are also constrained "
"to be between 0 and the total size of the widget. If *newpos* is omitted, "
"return the current position of the sash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1841
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Radiobutton` widget, used as part of a group to control a single "
"shared variable by selecting one of several mutually exclusive values. It is "
"the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Radiobutton` and inherits the "
"common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1848
msgid ""
"Set the option variable to the button's value, select the button, invoke the "
"command associated with the button, and return its result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1854
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Scale` widget, displays a slider that lets the user select a "
"numeric value from a range by moving the slider along a trough. It is the "
"themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Scale` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1861
msgid ""
"Modify or query the widget options, like :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter."
"Misc.configure>`. In addition, this method clips the ``from`` and ``to`` "
"values so that the current value stays within the range defined by them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1866
msgid ""
"Now returns the configuration value, like :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter."
"Misc.configure>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1873
msgid ""
"Return the current value of the scale. If *x* and *y* are given, return the "
"value corresponding to the pixel coordinate *x*, *y* instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1880
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Scrollbar` widget, controls the viewport of an associated "
"scrollable widget such as a :class:`Treeview`, :class:`Entry` or :class:"
"`tkinter.Text`. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Scrollbar` "
"and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`, as well as the :"
"meth:`!set` and :meth:`!get` methods from :class:`tkinter.Scrollbar`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1890
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Separator` widget, displays a horizontal or vertical separator "
"line. It has no direct counterpart in :mod:`tkinter` and inherits the common "
"widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1898
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Sizegrip` widget, displays a grip that allows the user to resize "
"the containing toplevel window by pressing and dragging the grip, typically "
"placed in the bottom-right corner. It has no direct counterpart in :mod:"
"`tkinter` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1907
msgid ""
"A :class:`Frame` containing a :class:`Scale` and a :class:`Label` that shows "
"the scale's current value. *variable* is the :class:`~tkinter.IntVar` "
"tracked by the scale (one is created if it is not given), and *from_* and "
"*to* define the range of the scale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1915
msgid ""
"Destroy this widget and remove the trace callback registered on the "
"associated variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1921
msgid ""
"Alias of :class:`Labelframe`, kept for naming compatibility with :class:"
"`tkinter.LabelFrame`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1927
msgid ""
"Alias of :class:`Panedwindow`, kept for naming compatibility with :class:"
"`tkinter.PanedWindow`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:11
msgid "ttk"
msgstr "ttk"
